OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells this
OL,7,Fafternoon. A few scattered showers,
OL,8,Fbut these dying out from the west
OL,9,Fduring by early afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome light and patchy rain
OL,12,Fwill spread east early this evening.
OL,13,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,14,Fcloudy and mainly dry with just a few
OL,15,Fshowers.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAfter a mainly dry start rain
OL,18,Fwill spread southeast across most
OL,19,Fparts, lingering into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
