OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday. Dry
OL,7,Fand bright on Thursday the odd shower
OL,8,Fin the southwest. A few showers on
OL,9,FFriday, mainly in the west.
